Movement & General Actions
Walk/Steer: WASD | PS5: L-Stick | Xbox: L-Stick
Look/Aim: Mouse | PS5: R-Stick | Xbox: R-Stick
Sprint: Left Shift | PS5: X | Xbox: A
Jump: Spacebar | PS5: Square | Xbox: X
Enter/Exit Vehicle: F | PS5: Triangle | Xbox: Y
Open Phone: Up Arrow | PS5: Up D-pad | Xbox: Up D-pad
Pause Menu: Esc | PS5: Options | Xbox: Menu

Combat & Weapons
Aim Weapon: Right Mouse | PS5: L2 | Xbox: LT
Fire Weapon: Left Mouse | PS5: R2 | Xbox: RT
Weapon Wheel: Tab | PS5: L1 | Xbox: LB
Reload: R | PS5: Circle | Xbox: B
Take Cover: Q | PS5: R1 | Xbox: RB
Special Ability: Caps Lock | PS5: L3 + R3 | Xbox: LS + RS

Vehicle Controls
Accelerate: W | PS5: R2 | Xbox: RT
Brake/Reverse: S | PS5: L2 | Xbox: LT
Handbrake: Spacebar | PS5: R1 | Xbox: RB
Horn: E | PS5: L3 | Xbox: LS
Headlights: H | PS5: Right D-pad | Xbox: Right D-pad
Cinematic Camera: R | PS5: Touchpad | Xbox: View Button

Plane Controls
Pitch (Nose Up/Down): Num 5 / Num 8 | PS5: L-Stick Down/Up | Xbox: L-Stick Down/Up
Roll (Bank Left/Right): Num 4 / Num 6 | PS5: L-Stick Left/Right | Xbox: L-Stick Left/Right
Yaw (Turn Left/Right): A / D | PS5: L1 / R1 | Xbox: LB / RB
Throttle Up (Accelerate): W | PS5: R2 | Xbox: RT
Throttle Down (Brake): S | PS5: L2 | Xbox: LT
Landing Gear (Up/Down): G | PS5: L3 | Xbox: LS
Weapon Fire: Spacebar / Left Mouse | PS5: X / R2 | Xbox: A / RT

Helicopter Controls
Pitch (Lean Forward/Back): Num 8 / Num 5 | PS5: L-Stick Up/Down | Xbox: L-Stick Up/Down
Roll (Lean Left/Right): Num 4 / Num 6 | PS5: L-Stick Left/Right | Xbox: L-Stick Left/Right
Yaw (Rotate Left/Right): A / D | PS5: L1 / R1 | Xbox: LB / RB
Ascend (Go Up): W | PS5: R2 | Xbox: RTDescend (Go Down): S | PS5: L2 | Xbox: LT
Weapon Fire: Spacebar / Left Mouse | PS5: X / R2 | Xbox: A / RT
